## YUM Commands

### Install & Remove
```bash
# Install from internet
sudo yum install firefox

# Install from local .rpm file
sudo yum install /home/bob/firefox-140.8.0.el9.x86_64.rpm

# Remove a package
sudo yum remove firefox

# Update a package
sudo yum update firefox

# Update all packages
sudo yum update
```

### Search & Query
```bash
# Search for a package
yum search firefox

# List all installed packages
yum list installed

# Check if specific package is installed
yum list installed | grep wget

# Find which package provides a command
yum provides tcpdump

# Check available package info
yum info firefox
```

### Repository Commands
```bash
# List all configured repositories
yum repolist

# List all repos including disabled
yum repolist all

# Count number of repos
yum repolist | tail -n +2 | wc -l

# View repo config files
ls /etc/yum.repos.d/
cat /etc/yum.repos.d/*
```

