## Common Errors & Fixes

### Error 1 — RPM Failed Dependencies
```
error: Failed dependencies:
       mozilla-filesystem is needed
       pciutils-libs is needed
```
**Fix — use YUM instead of RPM:**
```bash
# Wrong ❌
sudo rpm -i /home/bob/firefox.rpm

# Correct ✅
sudo yum install /home/bob/firefox.rpm
```
> 💡 RPM cannot handle dependencies — always use YUM for installation

---

### Error 2 — File Not Found
```
error: open of /home/bob/firefox failed: No such file or directory
```
**Fix — always include full filename with extension:**
```bash
# Wrong ❌
sudo rpm -i /home/bob/firefox

# Correct ✅
sudo rpm -i /home/bob/firefox-140.8.0.el9.x86_64.rpm
```
> 💡 Always run `ls /home/bob` first to check exact filename

---

### Error 3 — Wrong YUM flag
```
Command line error: argument -q/--quiet: ignored explicit argument 'a'
```
**Fix — `-qa` only works with RPM, not YUM:**
```bash
# Wrong ❌
yum -qa | grep wget

# Correct ✅
yum list installed | grep wget
```

