## Quick Reference

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `rpm -qa \| grep <pkg>` | Check if package is installed |
| `rpm -i <file.rpm>` | Install local rpm file |
| `rpm -e <pkg>` | Remove package |
| `sudo yum install <pkg>` | Install package |
| `sudo yum remove <pkg>` | Remove package |
| `sudo yum update` | Update all packages |
| `yum list installed` | List installed packages |
| `yum search <pkg>` | Search for package |
| `yum provides <cmd>` | Find which package has command |
| `yum repolist` | List all repositories |

